        "title": "Volkswagen Connect",
        "description": "Log in with your Volkswagen ID. You'll get an email verification code (OTP) for the volkswagen.de data source — enter it on the next step. (Optional/experimental: also enable a 15-minute EU Data Act request at https://eu-data-act.drivesomethinggreater.com.)",
